WEBVTT

00:08:00.434 --> 00:08:03.437
But actually, the picture
these days is not so clear.

00:08:03.479 --> 00:08:06.857
What modern archeology
tells us, for example,

00:08:06.899 --> 00:08:09.318
is that there were already cities

00:08:09.318 --> 00:08:11.904
on the lower reaches of the Yellow River

00:08:11.904 --> 00:08:15.574
over 1,000 years
before the rise of the Shang.

00:08:15.991 --> 00:08:17.952
And on the other side of the Pacific,

00:08:17.993 --> 00:08:20.538
in Peru’s Rio Supe,

00:08:20.579 --> 00:08:23.707
we already see huge
agglomerations of people

00:08:23.749 --> 00:08:29.129
with monumental architecture
4,000 years before the Inca.